# Three local projects (do not block each other)

| Project | Folder | Port | Role |
|---------|--------|------|------|
| Enterprise | `C:\Users\Win11\Projects\voucher-system` | **8000** | DMC admin / vouchers (`portal.magicsandsdmc.com`) |
| **Marketing (this)** | `C:\Users\Win11\Projects\magic-sands-marketingsite` | **8001** | Public marketing (`www.magicsandsdmc.com`) |
| Booking | `C:\Users\Win11\Projects\magic-sands-booking-platform` | **8002** | Hotel booking + partner portal (domain TBD) |

## Rules

- Work only in this folder for marketing tasks.
- Start with `.\bin\dev.ps1` or `runserver 127.0.0.1:8001`.
- Never steal ports **8000** or **8002**.
- Never kill, stop, or rebind processes on the other projects' ports.
- Do not run marketing on 8000/8002.
